IGHT: bold\">일 01시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">이고</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;15일 개관시간은 <strong>15</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일 05시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">, 15일 폐문시간은 <strong>16</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일 02시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">입니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 4. 14.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
